\f0\b \cf0 \
NEW IN VERSION 1.1\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\ql\qnatural

\f5\b0 \cf0 This version greatly improves AVI and DivX playback/conversion/editing/encoding. Also adds compatibility with the new video iPods and the DivX <-> iPod conversion.\
\
Batch processing is now possible. A new menu "List" lets you open the Batch List, to make batch conversion, and also the Edit List, to look at the cuts you have made to the stream. More details later in this guide.\
Some useful navigation buttons have been added in the player.\
If you own a DreamBox, the new Enigma menu lets you connect to your DreamBox set-top box directly. For details, see the section "Using MPEG Streamclip with the DreamBox".\
\
A new command "Open URL" can open movies directly from a web server. The Open URL command of the File menu, can now open and also download (or batch download) streams over the Internet, and it often recognizes and opens movies embedded in web pages. More details later in this guide.\
Compatibility with the iPod has been improved, and more H.264 presets are now available in the MPEG-4 Exporter. New iPod presets have been added, to support 16:9 movies; the last preset can be used for cellphones as well. The two-pass encoding is now iPod-compatible.\
MPEG Streamclip can now make DivX files with MP3 (MPEG Layer 3) audio, if 3ivx and Windows Media Player 10 or higher are installed in your PC.\
The "Save as" command for AVI files has been significantly improved: it is faster, and can now handle B-frames properly. Other improvements in the AVI exporter include proper encoding of AVI files with BMP and JPEG video, "lower" dominance for 3ivx, and a special frame size called "720x576 DivX PAL" that appear in place of "720x576 DV-PAL", when the 3ivx codec is used.\
An internal AVI importer and two internal AC3 and MP2 decoders have been added; this lets you play and convert AVI and DivX files with MP2, MP3 and AC3 sound.\
An internal high-quality audio resampler (aka sample rate converter) has been added, for better sound quality.\
Fixed many bugs, including: a bug in which the last few seconds of the audio track were not exported; a bug in which the video compressor used was sometimes different from the video compressor chosen; a bug in which the picture became darker/brighter when exporting with the same compressor; a bug in which the frame rate was not detected properly.\
Added support for MPEG-1 video in transport streams and in VOB files.\
In the exporter window, you can now rotate the picture by 90 and 180 degrees; you can make fast start QuickTime movies; an estimate of the final movie size appears when you enable "Limit Data Rate".\
The "Fix Timecode Breaks" command has been further improved with a new option, so it will not skip frames in VOB files. Moreover it has been modified to minimize the amount of audio dropouts in VOB files.\
Added a button "Open Anyway" in the open file error message; with this button you can try to open unrecognized file types.\
The keyframe interval for export has been increased from 1 second to 5 seconds.\
Added support for the 16:9 PAL format of the JVC Everio video camera.\
Added support for the following file formats: DCM (Sony), TP, VID (Homecast), JPEG, TIFF.\
In the frame exporter, you can now choose the picture format between JPEG, TIFF, PNG, and make adjustments to the picture.\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\ql\qnatural

\f0\b \cf0 \
OVERVIEW OF MPEG STREAMCLIP\
\pard\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\ql\qnatural

\f1\b0 \cf0 MPEG Streamclip is a converter, an exporter, a player, an editor, a downloader.\
\
It can open many file formats: muxed files MPEG, MPG, VOB, PS, M2P, MOD, VRO, DAT, DCM, VDR, PVR; transport streams TS, M2T, MTS, MMV, REC, VID, AUD, AVR, TP, TP0, TRP; demuxed files M2V, M1V, MPV, AIFF, AIF, M1A, MP2, MPA, AC3; QuickTime-compatible files MOV, DV, AVI, MP4, DIVX; pictures TIFF, JPEG;\
\
MPEG Streamclip supports MPEG-1 video, MPEG layer 1/2 audio, AC3/A52 audio and PCM audio. MPEG-2 video is supported if you have QuickTime Alternative ($0) and you chose to install the Extra QuickTime plugins.\
If you have Apple QuickTime, and do not want to replace it with QuickTime Alternative, you can buy the MPEG-2 Playback Component ($19.99) from Apple Computer.\
To open or encode DivX files, you have to install 3ivx for Windows ($0), and update Windows Media Player to version 10 or higher. Audio playback/conversion for DivX is supported now.\
\
Converter features:\
\'d0 from MPEG, MPG, VOB, PS, M2P, MOD, VRO, DAT, TS, M2T, MMV, REC, VID, AVR\
	to MPEG, TS, REC, VID, M2V, AIFF, MPA, AC3\
\'d0 multiplexing of M2V, M1V, MPV files with AIFF, M1A, MP2, MPA, AC3 files\
	to MPEG, TS, REC, VID, M2V, AIFF, MPA, AC3\
	(just open the M2V or M1V file, and the audio file with the same name will be multiplexed on the fly).\
\'d0 very fast, no loss of video quality, perfect audio/video sync\
\'d0 compatible with DVD authoring applications\
\'d0 special Headed format to import unsupported frame sizes in DVD authoring applications\
\'d0 special Unscaled demuxed files, for the QuickTime Pro media authoring application\
\'d0 can automatically join multiple VOB or TS files\
\'d0 manual command to scan the stream and fix timecode breaks\

\f5 \'d0 batch conversion\

\f1 \
Exporter features:\
\'d0 from MOV, DV, AVI, DIVX, MP4, MPEG, MPG, VOB, PS, M2P, MOD, VRO, DAT, TS, M2T, MMV, REC, VID, AVR, M2V\
	to MOV, DV, AVI, DIVX, MP4\
\'d0 supports any QuickTime-compatible video codec available for Windows, and many audio formats\
\'d0 very high quality encoding, all in YUV color space, either unscaled or with 2D-FIR scaling (better than bicubic)\
\'d0 motion-adaptive deinterlacing and chroma reinterlacing, with perfect audio/video sync\

\f5 \'d0 internal high-quality audio resampler\
\'d0 batch export\

\f1 \
Player features:\
\'d0 playback of QuickTime-compatible files\
\'d0 playback of muxed/demuxed MPEG/VOB files and transport streams with MPEG, AC3, PCM/AIFF audio\
\'d0 playback of MPEG files larger than 4GB, or segmented in many files\
\'d0 support for multiple audio tracks in transport streams and MPEG/VOB files\
\'d0 full screen playback, zoom with arrow keys\
\
Editor features:\
\'d0 cut/copy/paste of MPEG files and transport streams, at keyframe (GOP) level\
\'d0 frame accurate cut/copy/paste of QuickTime files\
\'d0 trimming function, with unique "revert trimming" feature\
\'d0 access to keyframes with arrow keys\

\f5 \'d0 edit list\

\f1 \
Downloader features:\
\'d0 playback and download of AVI, DIVX, MOV, MP4 files directly over the Internet\
\'d0 in some cases, playback and download of video files by entering the address of the web page in which the file is embedded\
\'d0 editing before saving the movie to disk\
\'d0 batch download\
\
And many more features are available!\
\
